  "reasoning": "The defendant repeatedly stole motorcycles, cash, and various goods, then sold or kept them, which constitutes theft (盗窃). The disposal and concealment of the stolen property indicates the crime of concealing or hiding criminal proceeds (掩饰、隐瞒犯罪所得、犯罪所得收益). He also stole military ammunition and a detonator, which are firearms/ammunition and explosive items, leading to illegal possession of guns, ammunition, and explosives (非法持有、私藏枪支、弹药;非法持有、私藏爆炸物).",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]盗窃;掩饰、隐瞒犯罪所得、犯罪所得收益;非法持有、私藏枪支、弹药;非法持有、私藏爆炸物<eoa>"
